   },
   {
    "id": "x2",
    "text": "Peak output = 12 V - 0.7 V = approx. 11.3 V\nRipple = I / (f C) = (11.3 V / 1k) / (50 Hz x 470u) = approx. 0.48 V\nTry C1 = 47u in the transient to see the ripple grow.",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 3700,
    "size": 50,
    "rot": 0
   }
